  "name": "Wall of Stone",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Earth_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You create a wall of stone upon a solid surface.</p><p>Draw a <strong>line</strong> up to <strong>10 spaces long</strong>, or a <strong>circle</strong> with a <strong>radius</strong> between <strong>1-2 spaces</strong>. Each space must be within <strong>30 spaces</strong> of you.</p><p>A wall of stone rises up in the selected area. This wall <strong>is 2 spaces high</strong> and lasts until the start of your next turn.</p><p>When you cast this spell, each creature within the affected area may make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check to immediately move to either side of the wall. Otherwise, it is forcibly moved to the side that you choose.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration of the wall by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p>",
